조\">대학 글로벌 현장학습</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">』</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; text-effect: emboss\">모집 공고</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">대학생 및 대학원생에 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">다양한 전공연계 해외 현장학습의 기회를 제공</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">함으로써 진로 및 경력 설계를 돕고 글로벌 감각을 갖춘 국가 핵심인재로 양성하고자 추진 중인 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2016</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">년도 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">차</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">대학 글로벌 현장학습</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">사업 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">차 모집</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">을 다음과 같이 공고하오니</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">대학 관계자 여러분의 적극적인 관심과 참여를 바라며 희망 대학 및 학생은 다음의 안내에 따라 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">또한 사업 참여방안 안내를 위한 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-far